+// 완성된 정확 거리 격자의 상주 배열과 삼각형 목록 용량을 합산합니다.
+std::size_t GridAndMeshIntersection::estimatedMemoryBytes() const
+{
+	if (!hasGridMeshIntersection()) return 0;
+	const auto count = m_perCellTriangleList.totalCellCount();
+	std::size_t bytes = count * sizeof(TriangleList*);
+	const auto cells = m_perCellTriangleList.data();
+	for (std::size_t i = 0; i < count; ++i)
+		if (cells[i]) bytes += sizeof(TriangleList) + cells[i]->indexes.capacity() * sizeof(unsigned);
+	return bytes;
+}
